WEBVTT

00:15:30.766 --> 00:15:33.034
(Aplauz)

00:15:33.034 --> 00:15:37.644
DžT: Ohhh. Šta je to bilo?

00:15:37.644 --> 00:15:39.915
Cirkus, rokenrol, drama.

00:15:39.915 --> 00:15:42.757
Šta mi to, kog vraga,
radimo gore na toj bini?

00:15:42.757 --> 00:15:45.419
Poslednja priča, na brzinu.

00:15:45.419 --> 00:15:48.289
Nakon što sam posetila to selo,
prešla sam jezero

00:15:48.289 --> 00:15:51.378
i videla sam vulkan kako eruptira

00:15:51.378 --> 00:15:53.131
na drugoj strani, Gunung Batur,

00:15:53.131 --> 00:15:56.216
a pored živog vulkana
nalazio se ugašen vulkan.

00:15:56.216 --> 00:15:58.237
Nisam mislila da će me vulkan progutati,

00:15:58.237 --> 00:15:59.823
uostalom, ovde sam.

00:15:59.823 --> 00:16:03.760
Ali vrlo je lako uspenjati se, zar ne?